   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"9\">\n  <li>Given the following table, what would be <span data-math=\"\\frac {f(x+2)}{f(x+1)}\">\\frac {f(x+2)}{f(x+1)}</span>?</li>\n</ol><br><br>  <table class=\"unnumbered\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span></th>\n        <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"f(x)\">f(x)</span></th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td>2</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>2</td>\n        <td>4</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td>8</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>16</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>5</td>\n        <td>32</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>",
